{%- comment -%}
  § 7 Abs. 3 UWG objection notice (existing-customer e-mail advertising).
  DORMANT: renders nothing while Theme settings > Marketing-Hinweise >
  "Widerspruchshinweis im Warenkorb" (settings.ms_uwg73_notice) is blank.
  Fill it only with lawyer-approved copy.
  Rendered in sections/cart-modal.liquid and snippets/cart-side-inner.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.ms_uwg73_notice != blank -%}
  <div class="ms-marketing-objection-notice text-xs md:text-sm text-foreground/75 mt-4">
    {{- settings.ms_uwg73_notice -}}
  </div>
  <style>
    .ms-marketing-objection-notice p { margin: 0; }
    .ms-marketing-objection-notice p + p { margin-top: 0.5em; }
    .ms-marketing-objection-notice a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
